stubs    PushCmd TurnUpkeep RollToHit ApplyDamage
stubs    CombatMovePlayer CombatSetActivePlayer ResolveHit
stubs    WoundLevel YellCmd IsCellFree
stubs    RemoveEntity Escape PrintName
stubs    MonsterSpecial ReportHit CombatantDistance
stubs    CombatMiscCmd ResolveShot EnemyInterferes
stubs    MeleeBlow ComsubsAttackCmd GetCmd JimmyCmd
stubs    OpenCmd SearchCmd ZstatsCmd UseCmd
stubs    ReadyCmd CastSpellCmd CheckMirror CombatKlimb
stubs    BreakCharm CountCombatants RandomCell
stubs    IsCellBlocked IsSurrounded FireMapTrigger
stubs    QueryStat ComsubsDistance PickNearbyCell
stubs    CombatPoison
stubs    Resurrect SetLightTurns
stubs    LookobjViewCmd LookSky LookCmd
stubs    LookCmdInDungeon AskDungeonCell DnglookViewCmd
stubs    Apparition
stubs    AskYesNo PrintShopText Provisioner
stubs    PrevItem NextItem PrintItemRow Healer
stubs    PrintShopFileText Armourer Reagents
stubs    FalsehoodSurcharge Greet ShoppesFarewell
stubs    Stables
stubs    UnequipAll EndCombat FadeFields
stubs    CmdsHoleUpCmd BoardCmd FireCmd IgniteTorchCmd
stubs    NewOrderCmd XitCmd HoleUpRest MixCmd
stubs    SelectSpell CmdsKlimbCmd
stubs    AnGrav SetSpellStatus PrintPosition
stubs    AttackWith HealMember AskDirection
stubs    InExPor WisAnYlem CastEffect KalXenCorp
stubs    TargetResists OnWho ChangeWindDirection
stubs    AimCrosshair CombatantAt DrawListFrame
